  "mmd": "%% Figure 13-3 — Governed Memory Write Decision\n%% A proposed write undergoes provenance, ownership, policy, retention, and contradiction checks. The unresolved eligibility claim follows the hold path; no completed memory write or receipt is shown.\nsequenceDiagram\n participant A as Agent\n participant G as Write gate\n participant V as Provenance verifier\n participant P as Policy checks\n participant R as Reconciliation checker\n participant M as Durable memory\n participant Q as Stewardship queue\n A->>G: proposes claim\n G->>V: checks lineage\n G->>P: checks owner / class / retention\n G->>R: checks conflict\n R-->>G: returns UNRESOLVED\n G-->>Q: references existing ticket\n G-->>A: holds assertion\n Note over M: No write\n Note over A,G: Required design process only; existing stewardship ticket\n",
  "alt": "A proposed write undergoes provenance, ownership, policy, retention, and contradiction checks. The unresolved eligibility claim follows the hold path; no completed memory write or receipt is shown."
